WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:05.550
Packaging decisions often begin with a guess. PackSense begins with the food.

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:14.570
Choose a sourced food profile, then enter the storage target, transport journey, handling, and pack size.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:22.500
The source record supplies composition and respiration where reported. Your conditions stay separate from measured facts.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.930
PackSense turns that scenario into protection needs: oxygen, moisture, temperature, handling, and food contact.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.390
It screens package structures and published supplier uses, while checking what evidence is still missing.

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:45.270
This submitted asparagus scenario needs evidence. Eight checks remain open, so no package is approved.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.900
Open the decision record and inspect its food reference, supplier listing, evidence gaps, and batch fingerprints.

00:00:54.333 --> 00:01:01.100
A clearer decision starts with a visible source trail. PackSense: food first, evidence always.
